 11-year history, including the Women Fighters Team (Mai, King and Yuri) and the Fatal Fury Team (Terry, Joe, and Andy). NEOWAVE features three modes of play - Super Cancel, Guard Break, and Max2. A new \"Heat Mode\" lets players power up their attacks in exchange for a gradual loss of health. A total of 43 characters including 7 Bonus characters. 12 of the most dangerous fighting teams ever assembled. Pick your team and fight it out in the original 3-on-3 battle format. Beautifully rendered background graphics. Activate \"Heat Mode\" to power-up your attacks. Revives the evacuation rolling maneuver and thrust attacks. Over-the-top Super Special Moves. 3 modes of play: Super Cancel, Guard Break and Max2. Link a Special Move with a Super Attack in the Super Cancel Mode to cause extreme damage.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/the-king-of-fighters-neowave", "videos": [{"id": 38608, "name": "Game Intro", "video_id": "_oQhFeeYDdc", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_oQhFeeYDdc", "title": "Whip Ass Gaming: King of Fighters - NeoWave - Attract Mode", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/_oQhFeeYDdc/hqdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 152696, "name": "Gameplay Video", "video_id": "A7uU-T74gdY", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=A7uU-T74gdY", "title": "King Of Fighters Neowave Gameplay Played on XBox 360 (Xbox 1) [60 FPS]", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/A7uU-T74gdY/maxresdefault.jpg"}], "collections": [{"id": 854, "name": "The King of Fighters"}]}